{"unit_id":"KHG420__git-worktree#card-zh","repo":"KHG420/git-worktree","commit":"2ad491e86ada2fcae580a9e7a0f638f62b882627","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git-worktree 是面向 DSH Web 的 Git 工作树与并行开发插件。它注册 Git 状态、分支和工作树管理工具，并在侧边栏工作区行提供创建绑定会话与清理工作树的操作。主要能力包括查看会话所在分支、为会话创建独立工作树、管理分支，以及把独立任务交给子 agent 并在完成后合并。适合需要多个 DSH 会话并行修改同一仓库的开发者；需要本机 Git 和 DSH 服务，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:18","index.js:71","client.js:28","lib/tools.js:70","lib/tasks.js:810"]}
{"unit_id":"KHG420__git-worktree#card-en","repo":"KHG420/git-worktree","commit":"2ad491e86ada2fcae580a9e7a0f638f62b882627","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-git-worktree adds Git worktree and branch tools to DSH Web, with sidebar actions to create bound sessions and remove worktrees. It delegates tasks to child agents in separate worktrees, tracks or cancels them, and integrates completed branches. Requires local Git; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:18","index.js:71","client.js:28","lib/tools.js:70","lib/tasks.js:810"]}
