{"unit_id":"KHG420__git-worktree#feature-session-binding","repo":"KHG420/git-worktree","commit":"2ad491e86ada2fcae580a9e7a0f638f62b882627","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git-worktree 的功能「会话与工作树绑定」：通过会话工作目录解析其 Git 仓库、工作树和分支，并报告同仓库的其他工作树。工具可查看绑定状态，帮助确认当前会话的代码工作位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/operations.js:223","lib/tools.js:71"]}
{"unit_id":"KHG420__git-worktree#feature-worktree-branch","repo":"KHG420/git-worktree","commit":"2ad491e86ada2fcae580a9e7a0f638f62b882627","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git-worktree 的功能「工作树与分支管理」：提供仓库状态、工作树列表和创建/移除操作，也支持列出、创建、切换与删除分支。创建工作树时可按名称放置并生成对应分支。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:200","lib/tools.js:248","lib/tools.js:305","lib/operations.js:378"]}
{"unit_id":"KHG420__git-worktree#feature-sidebar","repo":"KHG420/git-worktree","commit":"2ad491e86ada2fcae580a9e7a0f638f62b882627","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git-worktree 的功能「侧边栏工作树操作」：在 DSH Web 工作区侧边栏识别仓库及其工作树行，可从项目行创建绑定会话，并在工作树行移除工作树或处理关联会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:28","client.js:1512"]}
{"unit_id":"KHG420__git-worktree#feature-task-agents","repo":"KHG420/git-worktree","commit":"2ad491e86ada2fcae580a9e7a0f638f62b882627","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git-worktree 的功能「并行任务协作」：主会话可启动独立工作树中的子 agent，查询任务状态、取消本进程启动的任务，并将已完成分支合并到目标工作树。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:436","lib/tools.js:454","lib/tools.js:487","lib/tools.js:513","lib/tasks.js:810"]}
